# Game data. Nothing in this project ships or accepts a ROM into git.
# Users bring their own dump; see the legal notice in README.md.
*.z64
*.n64
*.v64
*.rom
*.bin

# And what a game writes back. A save is a cartridge's memory with the player's
# progress in it, which is the player's and not this repository's; running a
# game from the checkout leaves one beside the ROM.
*.eeprom
*.sra
*.fla
*.mpk

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Rust / CMake build output
target/
build/
build-*/

# The assembled app. Built by N64Bundler/build.sh, and every path inside it is
# absolute to whoever built it, so a committed copy would be wrong on any other
# machine. The pipeline's copy of the toolchain paths is absolute for the same
# reason.
N64Bundler/N64Bundler.app/
N64Bundler/src/toolchain.conf

# Scratch space used while bringing the stack up.
.research/
